{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20003","headline":"立德新居 八 · 孟郊","name":"立德新居 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手锄手自勖，激劝亦已饶。\n畏彼棃栗儿，空资玩弄骄。\n夜景卧难尽，昼光坐易消。\n治旧得新义，耕荒生嘉苗。\n锄治苟惬适，心形俱逍遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}